OL,3,GNEWSANI pay rises faster than inflation
OL,4,Afor third year in row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe typical worker in Northern Ireland
OL,7,Fsaw their real weekly pay increase by
OL,8,Fmore than 3% in the last year.
OL,10,FReal pay is the value of pay adjusted
OL,11,Ffor inflation and is a guide to how
OL,12,Fliving standards are changing.
OL,14,FThe figures come from the Annual Survey
OL,15,Fof Hours and Earnings (ASHE) produced
OL,16,Fby the NI Statistics and Research
OL,17,FAgency (Nisra).
OL,19,FNisra said that real pay has now risen
OL,20,Ffor three consecutive years, more than
OL,21,Foffsetting the falls experienced in
OL,22,F2022 and 2023.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
